{"id":"doble","lemma":"doble","pos":"adj","rank":868,"glosses":["double","twofold"],"ipa":"/ˈdoble/","forms":{"femininePlural":"dobles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-doble.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es un doble revés.","en":"It's a double whammy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519512"},{"text":"Tom tiene la doble nacionalidad.","en":"Tom has dual citizenship.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75643"},{"text":"Sólo hay una cama doble.","en":"There's only a double bed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604900"},{"text":"Esta palabra tiene doble significado.","en":"This word has a double meaning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585698"},{"text":"Él comió el doble que yo.","en":"He ate twice as much as I did.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527542"}]}